    "detailed_description": "Jigsaw Savant is a unique game combining gorgeous puzzles with an engaging and fun story about saving Christmas. You'll complete over 100 puzzles (with 4 difficulty levels to choose from and up to 615 pieces) as the story slowly unravels and you can save Christmas.<br><br>Apart from story mode you'll find challenges, achievements and a global high score chart. Race to finish the puzzles first, or play on higher difficulties with multiplies for disabling hints, snapping or adding rotation.<br><br>Whether you're a fan of visual novels or digital jigsaws, Jigsaw Savant has everything you need.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a warm, welcoming Christmas environment (classical music, fire, warm graphics). <br></li><li>Tired of losing puzzle pieces to your cat? Enjoy the new Realistic mode. You\u2019ll feel like working with a Real Life puzzle. But without all the drawbacks and with many digital advantages.<br></li><li>Check your genius level against historical figures (and cute animals).<br></li><li>Challenge yourself with many pieces puzzles (up to 615) and difficulty modes (easy, normal, hard, realistic). +Challenging score multiplier feature.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/b18dcd7226c005a4e3d7b19042dc831e.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Quickly relax with easy puzzles in 5 minute breaks (hints included).<br></li><li>Discover unique jigsaw mechanics in story mode.<br></li><li>Fine tune the game to your taste! Lots of customization options to change how the game behaves.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/690150150950c8b72ae973a4a02986fa.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li> Don't worry about losing your progress. Autosave feature included (during gameplay). You can also see a screenshot of your saved puzzle.<br></li><li>Enjoy 30+ hours of high quality opera, classical and other relaxing music.<br></li><li>Come back any time to your unfinished puzzles (automatic save upon exit).<br></li><li>Prepare yourself for long hours of entertainment and relaxation. 200+ in-game achievements await your magical touch! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/3c44bde9840b701aa3e0ab9fd890fb54.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Each puzzle also has mini-achievements. In total the game has 2000+ achievements to unlock.<br></li><li>Beautify your desktop by downloading a well deserved wallpaper (after completing a puzzle)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/447a3b3273eb3c249d724a0156185597.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Make the game look behave like you want! Customize various background colors and other options.<br></li><li>Remove the frustration of having a cluttered puzzle! Use the hugely large in-game bins (and their intuitive functionality).<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/c459b644a753e5f556a319663cbd619a.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Immerse yourself in an engaging Christmas story! Can you save Christmas? <br></li><li>No more staring closely into the screen! Use the versatile magnifying glass to navigate the beautiful puzzles. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/2a802f1824ebeb1464be7f3f35f32ec2.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Become smarter and happier! Listening to classical music it\u2019s proven to increase intellect! <br></li><li>Feast your eyes with classical painting masterpieces! <br></li><li>Get help from the community with a click (included Discord button in menu).<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/1ea68de6986125c68decfdfe7393f37d.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Forget the pain of hunting for corner pieces. Have them available separately with a button click.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949330/extras/7a1e5b38ff94c38204ec5921e7ad0aec.avif?t=1680252952\" /></div><br></li><li>Manage pieces with ease by using the flexible arrange patterns. <br></li><li>Keep track of the time spent in game.<br></li><li>Enjoy the satisfaction of gaining large score multipliers (by finishing earlier)</li></ul>",
